{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Please note: The current English version is based on machine translation due to the large volume of text. We are committed to progressively replacing it with professionally refined translations in future updates.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as an unknown rookie in the treacherous Jianghu. Through cunning and courage, carve your name into martial arts history and shape the fate of the martial world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Wuxia Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 1 million words of original martial arts story, with 5 distinct endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore 15 maps, each with its own unique storyline, and discover the tales of 5 major martial sects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Meet and interact with a wide array of characters, each with their own martial heritage, secrets, and hidden motives<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/78079df3495e9b95d615b297aaa7ffd6.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/78079df3495e9b95d615b297aaa7ffd6.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/78079df3495e9b95d615b297aaa7ffd6.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/a8e7ec221bef4678ce4858cc80b750a7.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/a8e7ec221bef4678ce4858cc80b750a7.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/a8e7ec221bef4678ce4858cc80b750a7.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Martial Arts Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Experience an intense side-scrolling combat system, feel the weight of every punch in intense martial arts battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Master over 10 types of weapons and dozens of martial arts styles, including Qinggong (Lightfoot), Neigong (Internal Arts), and unique techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize your fighting style by combining weapons and martial arts skills with the &quot;Three Talents&quot; system to create hundreds of combat builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/38a6a81a6d70c66689270fc1b9b6b116.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/38a6a81a6d70c66689270fc1b9b6b116.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/38a6a81a6d70c66689270fc1b9b6b116.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing Jianghu</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open-world gameplay: Sect wars, martial arts tournaments, bounty hunting, escort missions, prison breaks and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Life simulation: Raise disciples, start a family, go fishing, and more to experience the full life of a martial artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Random NPCs and emergent events bring your journey to life, creating endless stories and adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/3d7ae6c572e1330d824acb00f68dc594.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/3d7ae6c572e1330d824acb00f68dc594.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/3d7ae6c572e1330d824acb00f68dc594.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u9752\u840d\u8bc6\u6b66","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/8f7a3bb5eab6881745ecb85317533da1287d3eb9.jpg"},{"name":"\u7565\u6709\u5c0f\u6210","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/dc21989c85be9df69be5bc8fd39618c079f5f896.jpg"},{"name":"\u5fc3\u9886\u795e\u4f1a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/7e926db35a7fb6ae1c26ba97afce56aa0293a5ff.jpg"},{"name":"\u51fa\u7c7b\u62d4\u8403","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/6ec4cea841eac3b32421a109fd048652e1250ed2.jpg"},{"name":"\u767b\u5802\u5165\u5ba4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/d57c1d0cebbe58edbbd310c31f13472e806a1453.jpg"},{"name":"\u878d\u4f1a\u8d2f\u901a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/3fd58b8adf3dbab72ba01f74c205a83467583eb1.jpg"},{"name":"\u7089\u706b\u7eaf\u9752","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/40726653aad1459571e39d3033e849e598040d31.jpg"},{"name":"\u767b\u5cf0\u9020\u6781","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/deec48deabc26467037c4b49233c6757013a7ee1.jpg"},{"name":"\u9707\u53e4\u70c1\u4eca","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/ded758adcc27b68c4e354276b162d46f427931cc.jpg"},{"name":"\u8fd4\u749e\u5f52\u771f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2361680/5f5b18f7f146d2835d205589d9e91cad9a717c90.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2361680?t=1771829813","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771829813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/9ebdd81532f3a11ac6d0194687026098ebdadbdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771829813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/9ebdd81532f3a11ac6d0194687026098ebdadbdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771829813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2613210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Official Version Content &amp; Update Plan</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access to Full Launch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After more than 7 months in Early Access, with nearly 30 updates and 3 major version updates, Path of Kung Fu is officially leaving Early Access. The main storyline is now complete (with 5 possible endings), and we've added more open world content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Steam Deck compatibility will follow post-launch. Current performance may vary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Version Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main &amp; Side Quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 15 large maps (5 sects) and additional smaller maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 1 million words of rich storyline dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial Arts System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 10 types of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dozens of martial arts styles, Qinggong (Lightfoot), Neigong (Internal Arts), martial arts combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Divine techniques, the Three Talents Book system, and talents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clan Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Build your own clan, clan wars, annexing other clans, recruiting new clans, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Interactions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Companions, enemies, servants, family life, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Martial Arts Tournament, random events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Life activities: fishing, brothels, gambling houses, dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Constables, assassins, and other engaging content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Roadmap</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Expand sandbox mechanics &amp; systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Update Creative Workshop 2.0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Free DLCs</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Please note: The current English version is based on machine translation due to the large volume of text. We are committed to progressively replacing it with professionally refined translations in future updates.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as an unknown rookie in the treacherous Jianghu. Through cunning and courage, carve your name into martial arts history and shape the fate of the martial world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Wuxia Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 1 million words of original martial arts story, with 5 distinct endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore 15 maps, each with its own unique storyline, and discover the tales of 5 major martial sects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Meet and interact with a wide array of characters, each with their own martial heritage, secrets, and hidden motives<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/78079df3495e9b95d615b297aaa7ffd6.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/78079df3495e9b95d615b297aaa7ffd6.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/78079df3495e9b95d615b297aaa7ffd6.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/a8e7ec221bef4678ce4858cc80b750a7.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/a8e7ec221bef4678ce4858cc80b750a7.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/a8e7ec221bef4678ce4858cc80b750a7.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Martial Arts Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Experience an intense side-scrolling combat system, feel the weight of every punch in intense martial arts battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Master over 10 types of weapons and dozens of martial arts styles, including Qinggong (Lightfoot), Neigong (Internal Arts), and unique techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize your fighting style by combining weapons and martial arts skills with the &quot;Three Talents&quot; system to create hundreds of combat builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/38a6a81a6d70c66689270fc1b9b6b116.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/38a6a81a6d70c66689270fc1b9b6b116.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/38a6a81a6d70c66689270fc1b9b6b116.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing Jianghu</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open-world gameplay: Sect wars, martial arts tournaments, bounty hunting, escort missions, prison breaks and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Life simulation: Raise disciples, start a family, go fishing, and more to experience the full life of a martial artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Random NPCs and emergent events bring your journey to life, creating endless stories and adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/3d7ae6c572e1330d824acb00f68dc594.poster.avif?t=1771829813\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/3d7ae6c572e1330d824acb00f68dc594.webm?t=1771829813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/3d7ae6c572e1330d824acb00f68dc594.mp4?t=1771829813\" type=\"vi